          "text": "**Try this yourself**: Look at the reaction between sodium and chlorine (table salt formation).  \n2 Na + Cl₂ → 2 NaCl  \nWhich element is oxidized and which is reduced? (Answer: sodium loses electrons = oxidized; chlorine gains electrons = reduced.)",
